んだ～♪　こちょこちょこちょこちょこちょこちょこちょこちょ～♪」\n「とどめだー♪　(10秒間こちょこちょ。アップテンポで)」\n「はい、しゅーりょー！　おつかれさまでした♪」\n「ゆっくり深呼吸して体を休めてね。くすぐられた後って、体がゾワゾワしちゃうからね」\n「んふふ♪　ねぇねぇ、いっぱい笑ってたけど、どうだった？　楽しかった？」\n「気に入って貰えてたらうれしいなー。　もしそうだったら…」\n「(耳元で囁くように)またこちょこちょさせてね♡　うふふっ♪」", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@akinokaedevo/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1604042760558112768%2Fi-X9KEBR.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=67a6667bcca0bb2d61dc14fe45d89998", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1604042760558112768%2Fi-X9KEBR.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=67a6667bcca0bb2d61dc14fe45d89998, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1604042760558112768%2Fi-X9KEBR.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5013b882b3b3fddd34c94120e7e3e9d7 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1604042760558112768%2Fi-X9KEBR.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0e0cfee3137b12e6a5408ce369b152d3 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3027299, "nc": 129}, {"path": "/@akinokaedevo/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1604042760558112768%2Fi-X9KEBR.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit